{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21177","headline":"春晚寄杨十二兼呈赵八 · 元稹","name":"春晚寄杨十二兼呈赵八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蒙蒙竹树深，帘牖多清阴。\n避日坐林影，余花委芳襟。\n倾尊就残酌，舒卷续微吟。\n空际扬高蝶，风中聆素琴。\n广庭备幽趣，复对商山岑。\n独此爱时景，旷怀云外心。\n迁鸎恋嘉木，求友多好音。\n自无琅玕实，安得莲花簪。\n寄之二君子，希见双南金。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21177.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21177","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}